[Black "The rook behind the passed pawn"]
[Result "*"]

 { An old endgame principle is to place your rook behind the passed pawn, no matter whether it's yours or the opponent's. Leaving out a few exceptions, it remains highly applicable in today's practice. Let's see some examples on this theme, starting with a few classics. }  
 *

