Bd5 ( { Or } 1... Be4 2. Ke1 Kc3 3. Rc8 Kb2 4. a4 Kb3 5. Kd2 a5 6. Rc3 Kb4 7. Rxd3 $1 { and wins - Müller. Let's make a few more moves: } Bxd3 8. Kxd3 Kxa4 9. Kc4 Ka3 10. e4 Kb2 11. e5 ( { but not } 10... Bd5 10. Kb5 $2 Kb3 $1 { on the king's route theme, with a draw; } ) 
a4 12. e6 a3 13. e7 a2 14. e8=Q $11 a1=Q $11 15. Qe2 { with a quick mate after } Ka3 16. Qd3 Kb2 17. Qd2 Kb1 18. Kb3 { etc. } ) 
2. Rd8 a5 ( { Obviously, } 2... d2 $2 { failed to } 3. Ke2 ) 
